			"notes": "# Hyperspace & Wormholes v2.2.0\n\n## Hyperspace\n- Added Distortion Minutes option to change how long distortions stay for.\n- Added Keep Distortions Away From Bases option, and how far away they stay. Off by default.\n\n## Wormholes\n- Improved visuals of the Ultra Warp Ride.\n- Added Ultra Ruin, the home of Guzzlord, with its own music. Guzzlord can no longer be found in Crag World.\n- Everyone on a trip now gets their own Pokémon in the Ultra worlds. Other players can't see, battle or catch yours.\n- Pokémon from wormholes can no longer be knocked back or pushed around in the Ultra worlds.\n- Added a key to open a wormhole to your waystones, comma by default. Your Pokémon no longer needs to hold a Warp Stone.\n- Lodestones renamed in an anvil can now be travelled to by every player, even without Waystones installed. They keep their name when broken.\n- Solgaleo can now carry up to 4 players.\n- Music now fades between the Ultra Warp Ride and the world it takes you to.\n- Xaero's Minimap and JourneyMap's minimap are now hidden on the Ultra Warp Ride and in Ultra Space.\n\n## General\n- Hopefully fixed a crash with Effective when shaders are off."
		},
