			"notes": "# Hyperspace & Wormholes v2.1.1\n\n## Hyperspace\n- Pokémon with boosted levels in Hyperspace can no longer evolve or learn moves early. Evolutions, relearnable moves and TM moves now go by their normal level, while battles still use the boosted one.\n- Fixed boosted levels not showing on servers. Your Pokémon now show their raised level in the party and summary while in Hyperspace.\n- Fixed the task list being pushed off to the side at some GUI scales and screen sizes.\n\n## Wormholes\n- The Xurkitrees standing around the Ultra Plant can no longer be caught.\n- The Ultra Plant's own Xurkitree can no longer be caught until lightning wakes it up. Catching it early broke its animations."
		},
