			"notes": "# Hyperspace & Wormholes v2.1.0\n\n## Hyperspace\n- Added option to change Quick Battle move controls.\n- Fixed an issue where Floating Poké Balls would always give out 5 star loot regardless of the trip's star rating.\n- Fixed errors when rejoining a server while inside Hyperspace, caused by the increased Pokémon levels.\n- Dropped the shiny rates of Hyperspace legendaries significantly. Another leftover from before the mod went public.\n\n## Wormholes\n- Added support for datapacks that allow you to customise which Pokémon can be selected in any Ultra Wilds worlds or machine made wormholes.\n- The wormhole machine now pulls Pokémon from the red, blue, yellow and green wormholes instead of a separate pool.\n- Fixed boosted shiny odds on machine made wormholes. Sorry, this was a leftover from before the mod became public.\n- Hopefully fixed some issues with shader packs. Please let me know if you run into any.\n- Added additional Pokémon to the base wormhole pools.\n- Added option in config to set shiny odds for wormhole rings. This replaces the old option.\n\n## General\n- Added option to disable legendaries being available through any features in this mod.\n- Fixed an issue that increased the size of Alpha Pokémon significantly.\n\n## Wiki\n- H&W now has a wiki: https://pikaahhh.github.io/cobblemon-hyperspace-wormholes/"
