			"notes": "## Hyperspace\n- Reduced the levels of all Pokemon within the Hoopa boss fight by 10.\n- During a solo fight against Hoopa Unbound, players can now send out 2 Pokemon.\n- Losing the Hoopa fight no longer restores the task list or music.\n- Fixed an issue where the battle against Hoopa could get stuck if your Pokemon fainted as ally Pokemon were summoned.\n- Distortions opened by a Distortion Splicer open much faster.\n\n## Wormholes\n- The Data Monitor screen now turns on when charged, rather than when loaded with items.\n- Added SFX for when the Wormhole Machine is charged.\n- Moves used on a Wormhole Machine now use their hit effect.\n- Fixed a mistake in the Sun & Moon advancement description.\n\n## General\n- OHKO moves should no longer be usable on bosses."
		},
